  "components": {
    "customize": [
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffffff>六大学派</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffffff>名称</color>\n<color=#ffffff>专业化</color>\n<color=#ffffff>著名成员</color>\n生论派",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/09/30/237301566/a4d95720e9000c7bd218fe9626af1101_294404264336745305.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "生物学、生态学、和医学\n纳菲斯（贤者）\n考特里亚（高级研究员）",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2265,
        "name": "提纳里",
        "desc": "<p><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85)\">精通植物学的少年学者，现于道成林任巡林官一职。直率热忱，擅长教导脑瓜糊涂的人。</span></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2022/08/23/47826599/d039c6da9285163f46b85f0241f29c17_4850179515894860705.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2510,
        "name": "海迪夫",
        "desc": "",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/npc/Khedive_icon.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "知论派",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/09/30/237301566/cb4b89537741d5b8e2747bbf38d0f82f_2037862332208820716.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "符号学、语言学、和符文学\n卡瓦贾（贤者，已流放）",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3336,
        "name": "艾尔海森",
        "desc": "<p>须弥教令院现任书记官，有过人的智慧与才能。生活得自由自在，一般人基本找不到他。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/01/17/47826599/25249dd20b86c775fb35bdbbd805d9ec_8728328065423189518.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "（书记官）",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2967,
        "name": "珐露珊",
        "desc": "<p>来自「一百年前」的学者，喜欢以前辈自居，对各类古老文字与古典机关都颇有研究。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2022/12/06/47826599/38c12ab46678a4008f83a0e46c900ef5_8882167319536551047.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "妙论派",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/09/30/237301566/2e85c765283068e15ec9d3e74b4bc78f_3918983983732124056.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "技术、建筑学、和机关术\n萨赫哈蒂",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3608,
        "name": "卡维",
        "desc": "<p>须弥著名建筑设计师，对太多事物抱有过度关怀心。美学主义者，为现实所困扰。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/05/01/47826599/2270aba02b92034d7d76b4426be8f53b_3150066710540343521.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "加扎里\n明论派",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/09/30/237301566/f34598c9c657434f95f882a67b415c4e_4679533912836667378.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "天文、天文学和占星术\n阿扎尔（大贤者，已流放）",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2859,
        "name": "莱依拉",
        "desc": "<p>专攻理论星相学的梨多梵谛学院学生。时常梦游，长期缺觉，饱受睡眠问题困扰。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2022/11/01/47826599/48a495acadaf37f12d0a7f653d85bd83_2737945499491086468.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "素论派",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/09/30/237301566/46b97fb757608a8941e601af1b1d5daf_2373224971635337258.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "元素学、元素反应、炼金术、和地脉学\n居勒什（已退休）",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2813,
        "name": "赛诺",
        "desc": "<p>教令院内负责监管学者们的「大风纪官」。工作时比刹诃伐罗学院制作的「大风机关」更有效率。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2022/09/27/47826599/e09e2bda5e022611fad0dea1bb6518bb_1417979140564899210.png",
