      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "因论派",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/09/30/237301566/23c46061a428aa6f27ea66c4a56db445_531251778681453703.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "病因学、历史学、社会学、因论学\n伊斯坎德",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2968,
        "name": "流浪者",
        "desc": "<p>身份成谜的流浪人士。衣着打扮像是修验者，言行却并不是修验者应有的模样。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2022/12/06/36540823/24d97a22be742fb732ea96f625d1faac_8403570345904252714.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3447,
        "name": "提尔扎德",
        "desc": "",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/07/20/47826599/0035342481faa64111fb2f20260ac220_3438307208806317381.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "西拉杰\n萨齐因\n维克拉姆\n索海尔\n矫论派\n（约500年前~从教令院分离出来）\n历史和遗产\n那伽朱那\n那先朱那\n毕洛",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffffff>节日</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7032,
        "name": "花神诞祭",
        "desc": "<p>以花神命名、纪念草神诞生的节日。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/01/29/142453215/2d38414d32de25de70f2d158a19b7d82_994590663954521965.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 20
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "草神的生日庆典是由须弥教令院组织。\n学院庆典\n学院庆典是由教令院举办的盛会，可以分成「学院游乐会」和「学院争霸赛」。",
        "alignment": "center"
      }
